Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["\<\
Trajectories of weak-field orbital evolution via gravitational radiation \
reaction in Schwarzschild - de Sitter spacetime\
\>", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.985486270836956*^9, 3.9854863111557484`*^9}, {
  3.9854863673226585`*^9, 
  3.9854863903872185`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"eb54d39e-f0bb-b44a-87c0-\
868150b6f6a5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "In this notebook we show the plots of orbital trajectories for compact \
objects around Schwarzschild black holes influenced by an SdS parameter \
\[Lambda] (y in this notebook). Results of this notebook has been used in \
Villanueva, John Adrian N., and Ian Vega. \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Extreme-mass \
ratio inspirals in Schwarzschild-de Sitter spacetime I: Weak-field orbits.\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] arXiv preprint arXiv:2602.17154 (2026). \
https://arxiv.org/abs/2602.17154\n\nWe solve for the system of osculating \
orbital parameters,\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  GraphicsBox[
